WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.750
We set out to battle the
famous Blackghost Knight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.920
and after a fierce fight, defeated
Blackghost Knight Gerard.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.360
As a summoner, I can make a contract
with someone and make them my servant,

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.020
as long as they agree.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.040
My new King, I pledge my fealty to you.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:48.550
Gerard, I can feel your sorrow at the
loss of your family and country.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.480
After that, I came to the guild
to report on my victory,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.780
and met an older gentleman.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.470
It's certainly a beautiful day today.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.840
For you, it's the perfect day for
an adventure, don't you think?

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:09.320
Yes. I'd love to head out on one right away.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.790
It's good to be enthusiastic
about your work.

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:17.140
But you do need to rest sometimes.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.740
You're the one who said it was the
perfect day for an adventure,

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.930
Guildmaster.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:27.620
I can see why they're all
talking about you, Kelvin.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:33.260
Yes, I am Leo, the head of the
Parth Adventurer's Guild.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:37.560
I have a rather silly question
for you, by the way.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.410
Are you perhaps...

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.050
Crap!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.910
...from another world?

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:55.970
Name: Leo
Level: 78 Title: Analyzer
HP 328/328
MP 469/469
Age: 56 | Strength 351
Race: Human | Endurance 807
Sex: Male | Agility 490
Class: Swordsman | Magic 184
Luck 326

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:55.970
Skills:
Swordsmanship (Rank S) | Appraising Eye (Rank A)
Detect Presence (Rank B) | Detect Danger (Rank B)
Detect Magic (Rank B) | Detect Concealment (Rank B)
Concentrate (Rank C) | Instruction (Rank S)
Natural Regeneration (Rank C) | Concealment (Rank B)
Strategist (Rank A) | Persuasion (Rank A)
Perception (Rank B)

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:55.450
His Appraising Eye (Rank A) beats
out my Concealment (Rank B)!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.910
Which means he can see who I am!

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:13.150
Black Summoner

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.820
Ange told me about what
happened with Cashel.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:43.640
And then you defeated the
Blackghost Knight alone...

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:48.610
Or perhaps I should say, with your servants?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.340
You're a summoner, aren't you?

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.600
I should've been more careful...

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.060
I didn't expect this.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:05.730
I didn't expect anybody with
Appraising Eye (Rank A) to be so close!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:09.580
My King, straighten up!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.430
Gerard?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:15.200
You can't keep your status hidden forever.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:19.900
What's important is to make more friends
who you can share the secret with!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.050
We'll support you as much as we can!

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.960
That's right. You're right.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.730
You're right.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.120
I guess I can't hide from
your Appraising Eye (Rank A).

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.040
With that eye of yours,

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:40.050
you probably knew Cashel and his
buddies were criminals, didn't you?

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.600
Why didn't you stop them?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.850
I have to apologize there.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.390
Cashel's a noble from the
Militant Nation of Trycen.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.570
And it's hard to do much
about a foreign noble.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.550
I needed proof.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.430
He was a noble?

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:04.220
I had been making the necessary
preparations, though.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:08.530
And I was finally at the point
where I could take action.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.840
But I caught him first?

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.960
To be honest, I'm glad not to
have to do the extra work.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:20.130
He'll pay for what he's done.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.620
Glad to hear it.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:28.350
So, let's get to the point.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:33.520
I'm not here to be your enemy.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.160
If anything, I'd like us to be friends.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:41.780
I met others from another world, once.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.850
There are other people like me?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:50.400
The heroes of the Holy Empire of Deramis.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.230
Oh...

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.190
Melfina?

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:56.780
That's right. I reincarnated them...

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.510
Huh? You did what?

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.220
If you're curious, I'll tell you later.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:11.340
The Priestess of Deramis heard the prophecy
of God, and summoned the heroes.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.630
And what she said was...

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.310
The revival of the Demon King is upon us.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.570
The Demon King?!

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:27.220
Perhaps that's why monsters all across
the continent have grown so violent.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.540
The reason the Blackghost Knight
you fought was so strong

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.190
was likely due to the Demon King's revival.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:40.400
Even the heroes can't protect
an entire continent.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.930
If the Demon King truly is returning,

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:48.460
I'd like them to focus on his defeat.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:54.100
So you want me to protect you from
the monsters, instead of the heroes?

00:06:54.420 --> 00:07:00.890
This city doesn't have enough people
who can handle Rank B and higher jobs.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:05.560
We'll pay for the jobs,
and provide additional support, as well.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.500
I'll use my authority to
increase your Adventurer Rank,

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.920
and allow you to decide which jobs you take.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.860
That sounds a little too much in my favor.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:20.460
You were hiding the fact that you were
from another world, and a summoner.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.780
Why was that?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.860
It's because you didn't want to get involved

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.770
in some ridiculous power struggle
between nobles, correct?

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:35.260
If you're willing to help us,
I can promise you freedom, most of all.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.180
He's seeing right through you.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.950
No matter how gifted someone is,

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.340
they couldn't learn
summoning at your level.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:49.160
Your skills are already equal to
those of a Rank S adventurer.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:52.530
So I'm going to have you climb to the top,

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:57.510
before you're forced to
join someone else's cause.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.860
I'll help you.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:04.170
Your conditions are agreeable.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:12.550
Name: Leo
Level: 78 Title: Analyzer
HP 328/328
MP 469/469
Age: 56 | Strength 351
Race: Human | Endurance 807
Sex: Male | Agility 490
Class: Swordsman | Magic 184
Luck 326
Skills:
Swordsmanship (Rank S) | Appraising Eye (Rank A)
Detect Presence (Rank B) | Detect Danger (Rank B)
Detect Magic (Rank B) | Detect Concealment (Rank B)
Concentrate (Rank C) | Instruction (Rank S)
Natural Regeneration (Rank C) | Concealment (Rank B)
Strategist (Rank A) | Persuasion (Rank A)
Perception (Rank B)

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:12.550
Black Summoner

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:17.560
I heard you got promoted to Rank B, Kel!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.730
Claire!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.370
You found out fast...

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:26.140
All the younger adventurers
are talking about you.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:29.560
Personally, I don't want to stand out.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.210
Don't be silly!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.990
I've never heard of anyone being
promoted to Rank B so quickly!

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:40.690
Okay, tonight I'll make an extra side dish
in celebration of your promotion!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:41.670
Yes!

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:44.450
Your meals are so good.

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:50.150
But first, could you make me
some lunch, please?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.550
My King!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.520
Don't tell me that lady is also...

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.780
No!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.480
She is definitely not a
candidate for my harem!

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:04.170
She runs the inn I've been
staying at the past week.

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.380
Sob! Sob!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:08.010
You've already got me!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:11.130
Don't join in, Melfina.
You're just making it worse.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.060
Hey, Melfina.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.690
Yes, what is it, My Lord?

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:27.810
Tell me about the heroes you reincarnated.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.620
It was a little while ago.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.930
The priestess of the Holy Empire of Deramis
performed the summoning ritual,

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:42.440
so I found some smart-looking,
pretty boys and girls to reincarnate.

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:47.980
They're probably a pretty decent level now.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.490
You're treating that like it's
not a big deal, but it is.

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:58.310
The Priestess of Deramis heard the prophecy
of God, and summoned the heroes.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.370
And what she said was...

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.340
The revival of the Demon King is upon us.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.220
Heroes and the Demon King, huh?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.090
You gave them the stereotypical
"the Demon King's back,

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.030
so here, have these heroes," thing?

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:16.450
It has very little to do with you,
so don't worry.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:21.780
I've gotten very sick of Demon Kings,
so I'd rather you didn't get involved.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:22.750
Right, right.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.070
That battle was such a close thing...

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:38.670
Heroes and Demon Kings, huh?

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:40.670
Clotho!

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.930
Can you give me back the
reward money I gave you?

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.500
Good job!

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:56.740
This inventory skill you
Gluttonia have is great.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.610
Where does it fit inside your body?

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.970
Well, this is probably enough.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.700
Going shopping, My King?

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.620
Yup.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:18.360
Claire, could you set out another
plate for tonight's dinner?

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:20.810
Sure.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.090
Thanks!

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:29.680
You look quite entertained, My King.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.500
What are you going to buy?

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.170
A slave.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:37.090
I'm going to buy a female slave!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:38.890
What?!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.720
Black Summoner

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.970
Black Summoner

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:51.210
You're at that age, aren't you?

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.890
It's every man's dream, after all.

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:56.700
No, it's not like that, I said.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.720
Last time I passed by the slavers,

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.970
I thought about getting a
slave to enhance my party.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.400
Melfina and I talked about it.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.460
You're going to train her and
add her to your party, right?

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:12.740
Yeah. There's one I saw last
time that caught my eye.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:15.530
You've already got me!

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.800
Stop that, okay?

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:23.510
My fight with Gerard was a
close thing, to be honest.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.990
And I'm going to be fighting
a lot more enemies like him.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.910
I want all the combat power I can get.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.160
Makes sense.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:37.910
Slaves can't use skill points
without their master's permission,

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.170
so I'm looking for a slave who hasn't
been touched by another master,

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.520
and hasn't used their points.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:48.700
And one who can provide support
attacks from the rear!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.950
Sir! Sir!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.010
Are you okay?

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.210
Screw you!

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.740
I'm not buying that!

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.780
That slave's cursed!

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:14.780
That girl's the one I saw before.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:18.990
She's the half-elf I got in the other day.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:23.940
But she has a powerful curse that
burns anyone who touches her!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.370
Name: Efil
Level: 01 Title: None
HP 008/008
MP 015/015
Age: 16 | Strength 2
Race: Half-elf | Endurance 2
Sex: Female | Agility 4
Class: Slave | Magic 4
Luck 1

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.370
Assist Effects:
Fire Dragon King's Curse

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:33.370
She hasn't touched her skill
points, just like I hoped.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:35.100
Melfina.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:35.800
Yes?

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.680
What kind of skills do I
need to break that curse?

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:43.390
That looks like a Fire Dragon King's Curse.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:47.240
A Sacred Bless spell from a
White Magic (Rank A) user would do it.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:02.930
Damn it!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.330
I thought I could sell you for a high price,

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.890
but you're worthless!

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:11.910
Nobody's gonna buy a cursed slave!

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.310
You're the guy from before.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.130
You want something?

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.880
Hey, could you sell her to me?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.660
You just saw what happened, right?

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:32.190
Sure, she's a half-elf,
and yeah, they're rare,

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:34.450
and yeah, she's never had a master,

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.860
but she's cursed! She sets
you on fire if you touch her...

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.610
Is that enough?

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.170
Who are you?

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:55.650
Get out of there.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.840
From now on, he's your master.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.600
U-Um...

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.160
Uh...

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.580
Thank you for purchasing me.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:39.370
My name is Efil.

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.960
I'm Kelvin.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.560
An adventurer.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:48.080
I'd like you to join my
party and fight with me.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.270
But my curse...

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:55.180
Efil, how long have you been a slave?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.380
For as long as I can remember...

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:03.040
I heard I was sold as soon as I was born.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.550
I don't even know what my parents look like,

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.060
or why I'm cursed.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.360
I see. That must've been hard.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.330
No, I don't...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:19.060
I don't want to hurt anyone anymore!

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:21.510
Efil.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:25.830
Believe in me.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.440
How?

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:44.870
Efil, I don't know what you've been through.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:50.860
But from now on, you won't
suffer like that anymore.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:56.820
But I... My hands...

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.780
You're okay now.

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:02.670
You won't hurt anyone
else with cursed flames.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.500
The curse is broken.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:17.990
My Master... Kelvin!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.540
Looks like it worked, My Lord.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:30.510
That's right.
White Magic (Rank A)'s Sacred Bless.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:34.500
I just used my leftover
skill points to get it.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:44.690
Until you can summon me,
I'll let her have you, I guess.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:48.430
You've got a good heart, Goddess.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.400
I'm back.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:59.020
Oh, welcome back, Kel.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:00.460
Good timing.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.930
The food's already on the table.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:06.900
Oh, that's your guest?

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:12.420
Claire, do you think you
could find her some clothes?

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:13.980
After dinner is fine.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.600
I'm so hungry.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.670
Efil, her food's really good!

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.120
No, before.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:33.060
I can't let a cute girl like this
eat dressed like that!

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:35.580
We need to get her all
clean before she eats!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.310
Efil, it's okay.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:03.050
I don't know what's going on,
but leave her to me, Kel!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:06.280
Thanks...

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.820
We're back, Kel.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:35.620
Now, Efil, show your master
how pretty you are.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:47.090
Um, Master...

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.790
What do you think?

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:03.460
Sorry... Um...

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.420
You're beautiful.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.030
Um, I...

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:18.560
I'll do my best for you from now on, Master!

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:21.210
I look forward to serving you!

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:23.110
Yeah, glad to have you.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:27.460
Sorry, sorry.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.230
I kept you waiting, didn't I?

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:31.060
I'll get dinner ready.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:33.510
Thanks.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:37.380
Um, can I help?

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:39.000
Of course.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.000
A maid outfit?

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:44.580
Nice work, Claire!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:51.600
After that, Efil and I ate a
delicious meal made by Claire.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.410
It was so good that Efil cried!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:05.070
I told her about Melfina, Clotho,
and Gerard, and that I was a summoner.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.410
I told her I wanted to keep
all these things a secret.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:12.750
And then I had her take
the same skills I had,

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:18.240
Double Growth Rate and Double Skill Points.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:22.180
I let her choose how to
use the other points.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.980
I talked to Melfina about it,

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:30.010
Name:  Efil

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:28.190
and we decided it was best for her to start
picking skills now, so she could learn

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.690
to make decisions herself.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:35.620
All of that went fine,
but then we had a problem.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:40.010
I asked Claire for a room with another bed,

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:42.440
but she said there weren't any.

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:55.130
She's so cute... But...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:22:01.000
EP 03: A Secret Shared with the Guild, and a Slave Girl

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.880
I can't sleep!
